<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR STARTS UP AT $78-7/8 IN WALL ST.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR STARTS UP AT $78-7/8 IN WALL ST.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADR opened up at $78-7/8 in New York on Tuesday after closing at $77 3/4 on Monday.</p>
<p>The price corresponded to about 411.30 markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
